  "catalog_course_description": "- Detailed analysis of machine tool components, configuration and peripherals. - Comparative analysis of different drives, spindles, axis configurations and tool holding systems - Cutting force, power and productivity analysis - Accuracy of machine tools, static and thermal deformations - Machine tool selection and testing; dynamic rigidity of machine tools and modal analysis - Safety and maintenance.",
